{"description": "The MOD17A3HGF V6 product provides information about\nannual Net Primary Productivity (NPP) at 500m pixel resolution.\n Annual NPP is derived from the sum of all 8-day Net Photosynthesis\n(PSN) products (MOD17A2H) from the given year.  The PSN value\nis the difference of the Gross Primary Productivity (GPP) and the\nMaintenance Respiration (MR) (GPP-MR).\n", "extent": {"spatial": {"bbox": [[-180, -90, 180, 90]]}, "temporal": {"interval": [["2000-02-18T00:00:00Z", "2021-01-01T00:00:00Z"]]}}, "gee:categories": ["plant-productivity"], "gee:interval": {"interval": 1, "type": "cadence", "unit": "year"}, "gee:provider_ids": ["C1631984056-LPDAAC_ECS"], "gee:status": "deprecated", "gee:terms_of_use": "MODIS data and products acquired through the LP DAAC\nhave no restrictions on subsequent use, sale, or redistribution.\n", "gee:type": "image_collection", "id": "MODIS/006/MOD17A3HGF", "keywords": ["global", "gpp", "nasa", "npp", "photosynthesis", "plant-productivity", "productivity", "psn", "terra", "usgs", "yearly"], "license": "proprietary", "links": [{"href": "https://storage.googleapis.com/earthengine-stac/catalog/MODIS/MODIS_006_MOD17A3HGF.json", "rel": "self", "type": "application/json"}, {"href": "https://storage.googleapis.com/earthengine-stac/catalog/MODIS/catalog.json", "rel": "parent", "type": "application/json"}, {"href": "https://storage.googleapis.com/earthengine-stac/catalog/catalog.json", "rel": "root", "type": "application/json"}, {"code": "JavaScript", "href": "https://code.earthengine.google.com/?scriptPath=Examples:Datasets/MODIS/MODIS_006_MOD17A3HGF", "rel": "related", "title": "Run the example for MODIS/006/MOD17A3HGF in the Earth Engine Code Editor", "type": "text/html"}, {"href": "https://developers.google.com/earth-engine/datasets/images/MODIS/MODIS_006_MOD17A3HGF_sample.png", "rel": "preview", "type": "image/png"}, {"href": "https://developers.google.com/earth-engine/datasets/catalog/MODIS_006_MOD17A3HGF#terms-of-use", "rel": "licens